  "title": "5 days in Kampot & Siem Reap",
  "summary": "Experience the charm of Kampot with strolls by the Kampot Riverside Promenade, visits to the Kampot Old Bridge, Kampot Durian Monument, Old Market Morning Cafe, and scenic stops including the Kampot Salt Fields, Phnom Chhngok Cave Temple, Teuk Chhou Rapids, and a Kampot Pepper Farm Visit, complemented by meals at Riverbank Pepper Crab and Bokor View Bistro, as well as a Countryside Tuk-tuk Loop. Afterwards, journey to Siem Reap to explore Angkor Wat, the Angkor National Museum, Pub Street, Angkor Night Market, Kuy Teav Alley Stall, and shop or dine at the Old Market (Psar Chas), Old Market Lok Lak House, and Apsara Dinner Pavilion.",
